  "description": "*\"Am I a beast or a human?\"*\n\nThis is the question that has plagued Leon his entire life. Born of a human mother and an ogre father, he has spent his days in hiding, away from those who would brand him an abomination. But after a threat to his village forces Leon to unleash the violent nature he had been suppressing, his existence becomes known to the world... With relentless hunters now on his tail, Leon must face his true nature and fight for his life against a world that demands his death.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
